// Hidden test for PR #26 T2 atomic bid core
// Generated by PDGGK reviewer (bug-free standard 5.23 02:09)
// Coverage gap vs PR #27: PR #27 is store/Lua-only; this exercises the WS
// dispatch path for malformed BID_PLACE, bad money strings, oversized
// clientBidId, binary-ish invalid JSON data, and frame-limit constants.
// Run: go test -run TestT2HiddenWS ./apps/lumen/internal/server/...
